  <item>
    <title>25. 40不惑是想通了？还是放弃了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c79688a56ca3e0c473d2f6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c79688a56ca3e0c473d2f6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Sep 2025 04:36:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>40岁，一个极为被女性关注的年纪，到底背后意味着什么？有人说40岁人生才刚刚开始，也有人说40岁就应该认命。</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span>步入中年的我们，是想通了、更豁达了，还是懒得想、放弃了？我们曾经做过什么或勇敢或后悔的决定，塑造了现在的生活？40+变得更自由了吗？事业还有更宏大的目标嘛？仍然期待爱情么？学会爱自己了么？</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span>关于40+的事业爱情、中年焦虑、自我探索和得到放下，本期请到了年龄跨度长达十年的两位嘉宾，和大家聊聊40+的中女生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cindy：45岁，家庭CEO，全职家庭主妇、2娃妈妈，坐标深圳。</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span>Lily：52岁，设计师、餐厅主理人、健身教练，坐标深圳。小红书：扎西哥是女生</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsvC137iij3WDjfwf_hTSHc7vE3e.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FilImrs-yKrvPMczTxHzJ-LgAlaA.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpD7e0Yrx6fLkzJivYiYFfesruoo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>BGM:Killswitch Lullaby</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span>这里是《越来越好》的第25期节目。</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span>祝正在收听的你，越来越好。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容提要】</span><br><span>快问快答：</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 年轻时候幻想自己40岁时什么样子？</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 这个年纪，发现自己和年轻时最大的不同是？</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 最近一次主动学习新东西是学什么？</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> 每周一定会坚持的一个小习惯是什么？</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 有没有一样东西，陪伴你超过10年还在用？</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> 现在让你觉得“时间不够用”的，通常是哪类事？</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a> 如果给生活做减法，最先想减掉的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part1：大家关注的事业爱情家庭婚姻</span><br><span>概括下自己40岁以后的心态和状态。</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> Cindy知足常乐、心态平和、豁达、张弛有度。</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> Lily乱七八糟、中年危机、自我否定与辛苦探索。</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 小烟意犹未尽、存在性疲劳明显、心有余力不足。</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 现阶段对“事业、爱情、家庭、健康、爱好”的排序。</span><strong><br><span>40+以后我们更自由了么？</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a> Cind家庭稳定、身心自由</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> Lily能拒绝做自己不想做的事儿</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 小烟放弃了对婚姻和孩子的幻想 心态很自由</span><strong><br><span>我们的中年焦虑主要焦虑什么？</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a> Cindy焦虑自己没有价值</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> Lily没结婚、事业也暂未起色</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1584">26:24</a> 小烟中等焦虑 事业发展和养老规划</span><strong><br><span>金钱观/财富观有什么大的变化么？</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">29:26</a> Cindy财富范畴更宽泛 稳住基本盘</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> Lily低欲望的结果是综合比较自由</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 小烟心态比较自由 财务相对自由</span><strong><br><span>未来5-10年我们的事业目标和人生规划</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> Cindy把书写好卖好 把家庭经营好</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> Lily扎根社区 把事业做的更好</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 小烟事业做久做强 规划半退休</span><strong><br><span>近10年最勇敢/后悔的决定是什么？</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> Cindy离开职场 回归家庭</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a> Lily40岁第一次创业</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2313">38:33</a> 小烟38岁离婚开始第二次创业</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part2：爱情/家庭/亲子/自我</span><br><span>目前家庭关系中安心暖心的时刻。</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a> Cindy物质上的安全感和精神上的被重视</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2646">44:06</a> 小烟感受到了有姐妹的好 独处的平静</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2754">45:54</a> Lily和宠物一起的治愈时刻 运动的心流</span><strong><br><span>30-40-50，对亲密关系的期待的变化</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2945">49:05</a> 小烟从不甘心到接受现实</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a> Lily姐弟恋实际上并不美好</span><strong><br><span>如何平衡亲情与自我</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3252">54:12</a> Cindy没有平衡只有取舍 先照顾好自己</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3305">55:05</a> Lily与原生家庭的关系在经营中变好了 </span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3378">56:18</a> 小烟做问心无愧和不后悔的事情</span><strong><br><span>自我认可有变化么？学会“爱自己”了吗？</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3425">57:05</a> Cindy超爱自己，爱自己的前提就是自我认可</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3507">58:27</a> 小烟自我认可一般，爱自己的路上有进展</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3552">59:12</a> 每天或者每周会刻意留时间给自己吗？</span><strong><br><span>什么时候感觉到衰老的？给健康做了什么计划或投资？</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3642">60:42</a> 小烟肩周炎手术</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3658">60:58</a> Cindy围绝经期</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3698">61:38</a> Lily还没生理上的感觉 </span><strong><br><span>比起“得到”，现在更在意“放下”的东西是什么？</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3926">65:26</a> Cindy知足、放下欲望</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3947">65:47</a> Lily没想过这个问题</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3954">65:54</a> 小烟放下条条框框和执念</span><strong><br><span>如何看待“孤独”？学会和孤独相处了么？</span><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3985">66:25</a> Cindy以前觉得孤独很可怜</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4026">67:06</a> Lily再也不会向外求去排解孤独了</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4105">68:25</a> 小烟和孤独相处很有天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下渠道也可收听我们的节目：</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span>小宇宙｜QQ音乐｜苹果播客</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span>网易云音乐｜喜马拉雅｜荔枝FM</span><strong><br><span></span></strong><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60e7c0730000000001009f2a" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60e7c0730000000001009f2a"><span>越来越好</span></a></p>]]></description>
